ent_id),\n   361\t            _ => None,\n   362\t        })\n   363\t        .collect::<Vec<_>>();\n   364\t    assert_eq!(selected_agents.last(), Some(&agent_id));\n   365\t}\n   366\t\n   367\t#[test]\n   368\tfn controller_does_not_start_review_until_patch_agent_reports_done() {\n   369\t    let root = git_repo(\"workspace-review-waits-for-done\");\n   370\t    fs::write(root.join(\"README.md\"), \"before\\n\").unwrap();\n  1060\t    ));\n  1061\t}\n  1062\t\n  1063\t#[test]\n  1064\tfn terminal_app_review_completion_yes_closes_and_typing_reopens_patch_chat() {\n  1065\t    let root = git_repo(\"terminal-app-review-feature-done\");\n  1066\t    fs::write(root.join(\"README.md\"), \"before\\n\").unwrap();\n  1067\t    Command::new(\"git\")\n  1068\t        .current_dir(&root)\n  1069\t        .args([\"add\", \"README.md\"])\n  1070\t        .status()\n  1071\t        .unwrap();\n  1072\t    Command::new(\"git\")\n  1073\t        .current_dir(&root)\n  1074\t        .args([\"commit\", \"-m\", \"ADD initial readme fixture\"])\n  1075\t        .status()\n  1076\t        .unwrap();\n  1077\t\n  1078\t    let backend = FakeBackend::new([\n  1079\t        \"implemented patch\\n@work-leaf patch update readme\\n--- a/README.md\\n+++ b/README.md\\n@@ -1 +1 @@\\n-before\\n+after\\n@work-leaf end\\n@work-leaf done\",\n  1080\t        \"summary: README changes from before to after\",\n  1081\t        \"NO_FINDINGS\",\n  1082\t        \"follow-up reply\",\n  1083\t    ]);\n  1084\t    let recorder = backend.clone();\n  1085\t    let chat = CommandChat::new(root, backend).with_max_review_rounds(4);\n  1086\t    let mut app = TerminalApp::new(chat, 100, 24);\n  1087\t\n  1088\t    app.handle_bytes(b\":new update readme\\n\");\n  1089\t    assert!(app.wait_for_idle(Duration::from_secs(2)));\n  1090\t\n  1091\t    let agent_id = AgentId::new(\"user-1\").unwrap();\n  1092\t    assert_eq!(app.ui().selected_agent(), Some(&agent_id));\n  1093\t    assert!(\n  1094\t        app.render_frame()\n  1095\t            .contains(\"work-leaf: Is this feature done? yes/no\")\n  1096\t    );\n  1097\t    assert!(app.ui().render_left_pane().contains(\"READY\"));\n  1098\t\n  1099\t    app.handle_bytes(b\"yes\\n\");\n  1100\t\n  1101\t    assert!(!app.ui().render_left_pane().contains(\" user-1  working:\"));\n  1102\t    assert!(!recorder.sends().iter().any(|(_, prompt)| prompt == \"yes\"));\n  1103\t\n  1104\t    app.handle_bytes(b\"needs another polish pass\\n\");\n  1105\t\n  1106\t    assert!(app.ui().render_left_pane().contains(\" user-1  working:\"));\n  1107\t    assert!(app.wait_for_frame_contains(\"follow-up reply\", Duration::from_secs(1)));\n  1108\t    assert!(\n  1109\t        recorder.sends().iter().any(|(target, prompt)| {\n  1110\t            target == &agent_id && prompt == \"needs another polish pass\"\n  1111\t        })\n  1112\t    );\n  1113\t}\n  1114\t\n  1115\t#[test]\n  1116\tfn terminal_app_names_user_session_from_first_prompt_immediately() {\n  1117\t    let backend = FakeBackend::new([\"launch reply\"]);\n  1118\t    let chat = CommandChat::new(PathBuf::from(\"/repo\"), backend);\n  1119\t    let mut app = TerminalApp::new(chat, 100, 24);\n  1120\t\n    20\t\n    21\t#[test]\n    22\tfn scripted_harness_rings_and_highlights_ready_chat() {\n    23\t    let mut harness = UiHarness::new(100, 24);\n    24\t\n    25\t    assert!(!harness.render_frame().starts_with('\\u{7}'));\n    26\t\n    27\t    harness\n    28\t        .mark_agent_ready(\"user-2\")\n    29\t        .expect(\"fixture user-2 agent is registered\");\n    30\t\n    31\t    let ready_frame = harness.render_frame();\n    32\t    assert!(ready_frame.starts_with('\\u{7}'));\n    33\t    assert!(ready_frame.contains(\"\\u{1b}[7m test user-2 READY\\u{1b}[0m\"));\n    34\t    assert!(!harness.render_frame().starts_with('\\u{7}'));\n    35\t}\n    36\t\n    37\t#[test]\n    38\tfn scripted_harness_reopens_hidden_chat_when_activated_again() {\n    39\t    let mut harness = UiHarness::new(100, 24);\n    40\t\n    41\t    harness.handle_byte(b'x');\n    42\t\n    43\t    assert!(\n    44\t        !harness\n    45\t            .ui()\n    46\t            .render_left_pane()\n    47\t            .contains(\" user-1  working:\")\n    48\t    );\n    49\t\n    50\t    harness\n    51\t        .activate_agent_chat(\"user-1\")\n    52\t        .expect(\"fixture user-1 agent is registered\");\n    53\t\n    54\t    assert!(\n    55\t        harness\n    56\t            .ui()\n    57\t            .render_left_pane()\n    58\t            .contains(\" user-1  working:\")\n    59\t    );\n    60\t    assert_eq!(\n    61\t        harness.ui().selected_agent().map(|id| id.as_str()),\n    62\t        Some(\"user-1\")\n    63\t    );\n    64\t}\n    65\t\n    66\t#[test]\n    67\tfn scripted_harness_switches_modes_without_enter() {\n    68\t    let mut harness = UiHarness::new(80, 24);\n    69\t\n    70\t    harness.handle_byte(b'i');\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
